<title>UK: Deutsche sets 2.0 bln rand zero coupon 20-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets 2.0 bln rand zero coupon 20-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLANDS BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL  (AA1/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    05.JUN.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  7.70	PAY DATE    05.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    7.45	YIELD	 13.866 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS   K) 5-50</p>
<p> SALE LIMIS US/UK/DE/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
